+## Threshold Gating (Day 22)
+- Added `--threshold <metric>=<min>` option to `frai eval` and SDK `generateReport` function.
+- Thresholds enable CI/CD gating: exit code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass, 2 for usage errors.
+- Report always generated; includes `passed` and `thresholds` fields when thresholds are applied.
+- Threshold passes when metric score ≥ minimum (0 to 1); metrics with no score fail their threshold.
+- Works with custom metrics passed to `runEvaluations`.
+
 ## Follow-up Tasks
 1. Integrate real toxicity/bias models once provider abstraction is implemented (Phase 0 → Providers milestone).
 2. Extend datasets loader to support configurable schema mapping.
